      "id": "tldr--292b44c481c0",
      "canonicalPath": "common/alias.md",
      "locale": "ne",
      "sourceLocale": "ne",
      "name": "alias",
      "title": "alias",
      "summary": "उपनामहरु बनाउछ -- शब्दहरू जुन आदेश स्ट्रिङद्वारा प्रतिस्थापन गरिन्छ। शेलको कन्फिगरेसन फाइलमा (जस्तै `~/.bashrc`) परिभाषित नगरेको खन्डमा उपनामहरुको आयु चलिरहेको शेल् सेसन् सङै सकिन्छ। हेर्नुहोस् पनि: `unalias`।",
      "platform": "cross-platform",
      "softwareIds": [],
      "candidateSoftwareIds": [],
      "exampleCount": 6,
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "सबै उपनामहरुको सुची बनाउनुहोस्:",
          "command": "alias",
          "line": 10,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.ne/common/alias.md#L10"
        },
        {
          "description": "एउटा सामान्य उपनाम बनाउनुहोस्:",
          "command": "alias {{शब्द}}=\"{{आदेश}}\"",
          "line": 14,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.ne/common/alias.md#L14"
        },
        {
          "description": "एउटा आदेशसङ्ग सम्बन्धित उपनाम हेर्नुहोस्:",
          "command": "alias {{शब्द}}",
          "line": 18,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.ne/common/alias.md#L18"
        },
        {
          "description": "उपनाम बनाइएको आदेशलाई हटाउनुहोस्:",
          "command": "unalias {{शब्द}}",
          "line": 22,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.ne/common/alias.md#L22"
        },
        {
          "description": "`rm` लाई एउटा अन्तरक्रियात्मक आदेशमा बदल्नुहोस्:",
          "command": "alias rm=\"rm -i\"",
          "line": 26,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.ne/common/alias.md#L26"
